1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
Narrator: Listen to a principal talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:09,120
Principal: I need to tell you again that your behavior on Wednesday's field trip will determine

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:12,070
whether or not you can go to the Redwood Forest.

4
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:13,418
If you behave on Wednesday,

5
00:00:13,418 --> 00:00:18,270
you will be able to go to the Redwood Forest in June with the rest of your classmates.

6
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:22,200
If not, you'll be staying at school with me.
